[{"id":"Mjc0-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{1}{8!}-\\frac{2}{9!}+\\frac{3}{10!}=....\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B8%21%7D-%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B9%21%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B10%21%7D%3D....\" />&nbsp;</p>","choices":["113/10!","91/10!","73/10!","71/10!","4/10!"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTExOTY"},{"id":"Mjc0-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Menggunakan angka-angka 1, 2, 5, 6 dan 9 akan dibentuk bilangan genap yang terdiri dari lima angka. Jika tidak ada angka yang berulang, maka selisih bilangan terbesar dan terkecil adalah ...","choices":["70820","79524","80952","81236","83916<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTExOTc"},{"id":"Mjc0-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada gambar berikut tabung berisi air, tinggi dan &nbsp;diameter tabung tersebut adalah 18 cm dan 6 cm. Kemudian ke dalam tabung dimasukkan 3 bola pejal yang identik (sama bentuk) sehingga bola tersbut &nbsp;menyinggung sisi &nbsp;tabung &nbsp;dan &nbsp;ai r &nbsp;d a l am tabung keluar, maka sisa a i r di dalam tabung adalah ... cm .","choices":["51&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","52&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","53&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","54&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","55&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTExOTg"},{"id":"Mjc0-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210112102711.PNG\" style=\"height:150px; width:61px\" /></p><p>Seorang ilmuwan melakukan percobaan terhadap 50 ekor kelinci. dan melaporkan hasilnya sebagai berikut:<br /> &bull; 25 ekor diataranya kelinci jantan.<br /> &bull; 25 ckor d i l a t i h menghindari jebakan, 10 ekor diantaranya jantan.<br /> &bull; 20 ekor( dari total 50 ekor) berhasil menghindari jebakan, 4 ekor diantaranya jantan.<br /> &bull; 15 ekor yang&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;pernah&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;dilatih&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;berhasil menghindari&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;jebakan, 3 ekor diantaranya<br /> jantan.<br /> Berapa ekor kelinci betina yang t i d ak pcrnah dilatih, tidak dapat mcnghindari jebakan?","choices":["5","6","7","8","9<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTExOTk"},{"id":"Mjc0-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya bilangan bulat x sehingga&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{1}{2+\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{1}{2-\\sqrt{x}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2&amp;plus;%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2-%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%7D\" />&nbsp;merupakan bilangan bulat adalah.....</p>","choices":["2","3","5","6","7"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDA"},{"id":"Mjc0-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan tiga bilangan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2^{4444}, 3^{3333}, \\: dan\\: 4^{2222}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5E%7B4444%7D%2C%203%5E%7B3333%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%20dan%5C%3A%204%5E%7B2222%7D\" />&nbsp;dari yang terkecil sampai yang terbesar adalah ........</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2^{4444}, 4^{2222}, \\: 3^{3333}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5E%7B4444%7D%2C%204%5E%7B2222%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%203%5E%7B3333%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2^{4444}, 3^{3333}, \\: 4^{2222}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5E%7B4444%7D%2C%203%5E%7B3333%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%204%5E%7B2222%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 3^{3333}, 4^{2222}, \\: 2^{4444}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203%5E%7B3333%7D%2C%204%5E%7B2222%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%202%5E%7B4444%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 4^{2222}, 3^{3333}, \\: 2^{4444}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%204%5E%7B2222%7D%2C%203%5E%7B3333%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%202%5E%7B4444%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 3^{3333}, 2^{4444}, \\: 4^{2222}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203%5E%7B3333%7D%2C%202%5E%7B4444%7D%2C%20%5C%3A%204%5E%7B2222%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDE"},{"id":"Mjc0-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Lima pasang suami istri akan duduk di 10 kursi secara memanjang. Banyaknya cara mengatur tempat duduk mereka sehingga setiap pasang suami istri duduk berdampingan adalah","choices":["3800","3820","3840","3900","3940<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDI"},{"id":"Mjc0-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam sebuah kotak berisi 15 telur, 5 telur di antaranya rusak. Untuk memisahkan telur baik dan telur yang rusak di lakukan pengetesan satu persatu tanpa pengembalian. Peluang di peroleh telur rusak ke 3 pada pengetesan ke 5 adalah ....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{80}{1001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B80%7D%7B1001%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{90}{1001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B90%7D%7B1001%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{100}{1001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B100%7D%7B1001%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{110}{1001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B110%7D%7B1001%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{120}{1001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B120%7D%7B1001%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDM"},{"id":"Mjc0-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui limas T.ABCD. panjang Rusuk AB 2 cm dan TA 4 cm. Jarak titik M dan rusuk TD adalah.....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B5%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2\\sqrt{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5Csqrt%7B5%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDQ"},{"id":"Mjc0-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sembilan lingkaran kongruen terletak di dalam persegi seperti terlihat pada gambar. jika keliling sebuah lingkaran 62,8 cm dengan &nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" /> = 3,14, maka luas daerah yang diarsir adalah<br /> &hellip;cm2&nbsp;","choices":["344","364","484","688","728<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDU"},{"id":"Mjc0-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210112111423.PNG\" style=\"height:123px; width:135px\" /></p><p>Suatu jam dinding selalu menghasilkan keterlambatan lima menit untuk setiap jamnya. Jika saat sekarang jam tersebut menunjukkan waktu yang tepat, maka jam tersebut akan menunjukkan waktu yang tepat setelah ...jam.","choices":["105","110","114","124","144<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDY"},{"id":"Mjc0-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di dalam kotak terdapat 18 bola identik (berbentuk sama), 5 berwarna hitam, 6 berwarna putih dan 7 berwarna hijau. Jika diambil dua bola secara acak, maka peluang yang terambil bola berwarna sama adalah ...","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{46}{153}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B46%7D%7B153%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{13}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B13%7D%7B36%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{4}{105}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B105%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{55}{162}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B55%7D%7B162%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{55}{152}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B55%7D%7B152%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDc"},{"id":"Mjc0-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210112111151.PNG\" style=\"height:164px; width:163px\" /></p><p>Perhatikan gambar di atas, persegi ABCD dengan panjang sisi 14 cm menyinggung Lingkaran Masing-masing sisi persegi dibuat setengah lingkaran dengan diameter sisi persegi tersebut. Jika diarsir adalah ... cm 2","choices":["49","56","112","178","196<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDg"},{"id":"Mjc0-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dikethui&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2^{2x}+2^{-2x}=2.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5E%7B2x%7D&amp;plus;2%5E%7B-2x%7D%3D2.\" />&nbsp;Nilai&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2^x+2^{-x}=.......\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5Ex&amp;plus;2%5E%7B-x%7D%3D.......\" /></p>","choices":["1","2&nbsp;","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","3","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B3%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMDk"},{"id":"Mjc0-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Rataan usia kelompok guru dan profesor adalah 40 tahun. Jika rataan kelompok guru adalah 35 tahun sedangkan rataan kelompok profesor adalah 50 tahun, perbandingan banyaknya guru dengan profesor adalah . ..","choices":["2 : 1","1 : 2","3 : 2","2 : 3","3 : 4<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTA"},{"id":"Mjc0-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui jajargenjang ABCD. Titik P dan Q terletak pada AC sehingga DP. dan BQ tegak lurus AC. Jika panjang AD = 13 cm , AC = 25 cm dan luas jajargenjang tersebut adalah <img alt=\"\\small 125 \\: \\: cm^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20125%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20cm%5E2\" />&nbsp;, maka panjang PQ adalah .cm</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{1}{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D\" />","1","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\frac{4}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B3%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTE"},{"id":"Mjc0-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{54+14\\sqrt{5}}+\\sqrt{12-2\\sqrt{35}}+\\sqrt{32-10\\sqrt{7}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B54&amp;plus;14%5Csqrt%7B5%7D%7D&amp;plus;%5Csqrt%7B12-2%5Csqrt%7B35%7D%7D&amp;plus;%5Csqrt%7B32-10%5Csqrt%7B7%7D%7D\" />&nbsp;=....</p>","choices":["10","11","12","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 5\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%205%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 6\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%206%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTI"},{"id":"Mjc0-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Hasil penjumlahan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 1!+2'+3!+...+2011!\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201%21&amp;plus;2%27&amp;plus;3%21&amp;plus;...&amp;plus;2011%21\" />&nbsp;adalah suatu bilangan yang angka satuannya adalah ....</p>","choices":["3","4","5","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small \\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 6\\sqrt{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%206%5Csqrt%7B6%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTM"},{"id":"Mjc0-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Lima orang akan pergi ke pantai menggunakan sebuah mobil berkapasitas 6 tempat duduk. Jika hanya ada dua orang yang bisa menjadi sopir. maka banyaknya cara mengatur tempat duduk di dalam mobil adalah ...","choices":["60","120","180","240","280<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTQ"},{"id":"Mjc0-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah bingkai foto yang berbentuk persegi diputar 45 o dengan sumbu putar titik perpotongan diagonal-diagonalnya. Jika panjang sisi persegi adalah 1 cm. Luas irisan antara bingkai foto sebelum dan sesudah diputar adalah ... cm 2</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 1+2\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201&amp;plus;2%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2+2\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202&amp;plus;2%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","1","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2-2\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202-2%5Csqrt%7B2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small 2\\sqrt{2}-2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5Csqrt%7B2%7D-2\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTU"},{"id":"Mjc0-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Lima permen identik (berbentuk sama). satu rasa apel. dua rasa jeruk dan dua rasa jahe akan dibagikan kepada lima sekawan Anto, Bono, Carli, Dodo dan Edo, sehingga masing-masing mendapat satu permen. Peluang Anto mendapat permen rasa jahe adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTY"},{"id":"Mjc0-q22","number":22,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jumlah angka-angka dari hasil kali bilangan 999999999 dengan 12345679 adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTc"},{"id":"Mjc0-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambar berikut. ABCD persegi dengan panjang sisi sisinya adalah 2 cm. E adalah titik tengah CD dan F adalah titik tengah AD. Luas daerah EDFGH adalah ...</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210112130112.PNG\" style=\"height:160px; width:179px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTg"},{"id":"Mjc0-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai jumlah bilangan berikut adalah ....</p><p><img alt=\"1^2-2^2+3^2-.4^2+5^2-....2010^2+2011^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%5E2-2%5E2&amp;plus;3%5E2-.4%5E2&amp;plus;5%5E2-....2010%5E2&amp;plus;2011%5E2\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMTk"},{"id":"Mjc0-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika barisan x1,x2,x3..... mememilih x1+x2+x3+......+xn=3n untuk semua n bilanagan asli&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjA"},{"id":"Mjc0-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Semua pasangan bilangan bulat (a,b) yarig mememihi <img alt=\"\\small 2^a = b^2 - 1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%5Ea%20%3D%20b%5E2%20-%201\" /> adalah</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjE"},{"id":"Mjc0-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tersedia beberapa angka 2. 0, dan 1. Angka dua ada sebanyak lima buah masing-masing berwarna merah, hijau, kuning, biru dan nila. Angka nol dan satu masing-masing ada sebanyak empat buah dengan warna masing-masing merah, hijau, kuning dan biru. Selanjutnya menggunakan angka -angka tersebut akan dibentuk bilangan 2011 sehingga &nbsp;angka-angka yang &nbsp;bersebelahan &nbsp;tidak &nbsp;boleh &nbsp;sewarna. Contoh pewarnaan yang dimaksud: 2 (merah) 0 (hijau) 1(merah) 1 (biru). contoh bukan pewarnaan yang dimaksud: 2 (merah) 0 (hijau) 1 (hijau 1 (biru). Banyaknya bilangan<br /> 2011 dengan komposisi pewarnaan tersebut adalah ...<br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjI"},{"id":"Mjc0-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah kotak berisi 500 kelereng berukuran sama yang terdiri dari 5 warna dimana masing- masing kelereng sewarna berjumlah 100. Minimum banyaknya kelereng yang harus diambil secara acak sedemikian sehingga kelereng yang terambil dijamin memuat sedikitnya 5 kelereng yang berwarna sama adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjM"},{"id":"Mjc0-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20210112154411.PNG\" style=\"height:22px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjQ"},{"id":"Mjc0-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu himpunan disebut berjenis H jika memenuhi sifat:<br /> a) Himpunan tersebut beranggotakan tiga bilangan bulat tak negatif.<br /> b) Rata-rata ketiga bilangan anggota himpunan tersebut adalah 15. Banyaknya semua Himpunan berjenis H ini adalah ...<br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTEyMjU"}]
